description: |
  The verbosity level can now be set via the ``TMT_VERBOSE``
  environment variable, following the same pattern as ``TMT_DEBUG``.
  The envvar accepts values 1 to 3 and takes precedence over the
  ``-v`` CLI flag. Logging topics can also be set via the
  ``TMT_LOG_TOPIC`` environment variable using a space-separated
  list of topics, taking precedence over the ``--log-topic`` CLI flag.
